              <mxCell id="note_state_derived" value="Budget_Period has no stored state column, and as of 2026-08-20 no lifecycle either. It briefly ran open / locked / closed, derived from starts_on, ends_on and today&#39;s date; the owner then removed FR-16&#39;s lock, so &quot;locked&quot; ceased to exist and the rest collapsed into a date comparison that restricts nothing. There is no state diagram. The reason for the date pair is unaffected and still load-bearing: it makes quarterly and yearly rollups a date-range sum rather than a new column (NFR-3)." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontStyle=2;fontColor=#666666;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1420" y="500" width="200" height="170" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
